# App shell

`App.tsx` owns `pages[]`, `activePageId`, dialogs, and `savePages` on change. Orientation is per-page.

- Global shortcuts: `utils/shortcuts.ts` + `useAppShortcuts` (capture phase; blocks many browser chords). Editor-only chords: `extensions/editorShortcuts.ts`.
- Terminal: `DevTerminal` + `terminalShell.ts` (fake Unix over pages/theme/gemini/memory). Add commands there and to `HELP_LINES` / `KNOWN_COMMANDS`.
- Themes: `themes.ts` + CSS `[data-theme]` + `index.html` boot script (avoids flash). Storage key `pixelsetu-theme`.
- Export: `utils/export.ts` (markdown via Turndown, PDF via html2canvas/jspdf).
